# PRES-AIR -- W5-PRES air layer + jumpjet wobble + airborne voxel shadow:
# a Kirov (ZEP) in flight draws above the ground layer (air layer), casts its
# own silhouette on the ground; it does not bob (ZEP JumpjetNoWobbles=yes --
# the original's wobble only moves jumpjets without that key).
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click start
until 90 scene == game
require scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 600 built(0,GACNST) == 1
cheat spawn ZEP 0 building 0:GACNST +3 -3
wait 2
click unit 0:ZEP
click building 0:GACNST -4 +6
until 200 airborne(0) >= 1
wait 60
view unit 0:ZEP
shot kirov-a
wait 50
shot kirov-b
end
